#4303
bishop waterdeep~
the Bishop~
The Bishop of Waterdeep is here.~
He is garbed in the expensive robes of his office.~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 1000 S
50 BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 0 1d1+1039 1d1+32
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 2
    say Thank you for returning the Holy Grail.
    say I fear I have something else to ask of you.
    say A false priest has been raising the dead in our cemetery.
    say Please deal with him for us.
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
  else
    if quest(0, 4, $n) == 4
      say Thank you $n.
      say Take this for your outstanding service in our name.
      mpoload 4304
      mpoload 4303
      give i4304 $n
      give i4303 $n
      mpmset $n quest 0 4 5
      mpmset $n long (Faithful) $n is here.
    endif
  endif
~
|

#4304
archbishop waterdeep bishop~
the Archbishop~
The Archbishop of Waterdeep is here.~
He is garbed in the expensive robes of his office.~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 1000 S
70 BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 0 1d1+2799 1d1+47
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>give_prog i11905~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 1
    mpjunk all
    say You have done well.
    say Go to the Bishop and he will see to your needs.
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 2
  endif
~
>greet_prog 100~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
    say You look like a righteous soul.
    say I charge you with bringing The Holy Grail to me!
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
  else
    if quest(0, 4, $n) == 1
      say Have you retrieved the grail?
    else
      say What do you want?
    endif
  endif
~
>death_prog 100~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 6
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 7
    say You will pay for your sins!
  endif
~
|

#4305
half-decayed parishioner~
a half-decayed parishioner~
A half-decayed parishioner stumbles here.~
He is still dressed in what he was buried in.~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND -1000 S
40 BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 0 1d1+631 1d1+26
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 100~
  if time() == 6
    mpecho The half-decayed parishioner crumbles in the daylight.
    mppurge $i
  endif
~
>rand_prog 3~
  mpecho The half-decayed parishioner reaches toward you.
  mpkill $r
~
|

#4306
traitorous priest~
a traitorous priest~
A traitorous priest watches here.~
He wears a mockery of the robes of the priests of Waterdeep.~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND -1000 S
70 BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 0 1d1+2799 1d1+47
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 3
    say So those overblown windbags have sent you after me?
    say Serve me further by becoming my undead minion!
    say Would you care to make a deal?
  else
    if quest(0, 4, $n) == 7
      say You have served me well.
      say Serve me further by becoming my undead minion!
      mpmset $n quest 0 4 8
      mpmset $n long (Faithless) $n is here.
      mpoload 4306
      mpoload 4305
      mpkill $n
    endif
  endif
~
>speech_prog no nope~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 3
    say Very well then, you shall have to die.
    mpkill $n
  endif
~
>speech_prog yes yep ok sure yeah~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 3
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 6
    say Kill the Archbishop and I will make it worthwhile.
  endif
~
>death_prog 100~
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 3
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 4
  else
    if level($n) > 60
      mpjunk all
    endif
  endif
~
|

