#4319
Behind the Altar~
The walls behind the altar are covered in a rich wood paneling.  The
expense of the stains used on this section of wall alone could have fed half
of Waterdeep for a week.  The carvings in each section are intricate and
unique.  You notice that one section looks like an ornate doorway.~
